#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Find cut locations, given a maximum of 4 qubits per subcircuit. This circuit"
" can be separated in two by making a single wire cut and cutting one "
"`CRZGate` {#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-of-4-qubits-per-subcircuit-"
"this-circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-single-wire-cut-and-"
"cutting-one-crzgate}"
msgstr ""
"Temukan lokasi potongan, dengan maksimum 4 qubit per subcircuit. Circuit ini"
" bisa dipisah menjadi dua dengan satu wire cut dan memotong satu `CRZGate` "
"{#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-of-4-qubits-per-subcircuit-this-"
"circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-single-wire-cut-and-cutting-one-"
"crzgate}"

